        {
          "text": "Mutalubi inzila yoonse Jehova Leza wanu njaakamweenzya, myaka eyi iili makumi one, munkanda, kuti amubombye, amusunke, azibe makani aali mumyoyo yanu, na inga mulakonzya kubamba malailile aakwe na pe. ",
